-# NameChangeWatcher
-NameChangeWatcher OSRS plugin+# Name Change Watcher
+
+Name Change Watcher is a RuneLite external plugin that surfaces the previous-display-name information RuneLite already exposes for friends and friends-chat members. It is intended as a lightweight manual-testing/plugin-hub-ready starting point for keeping track of friends or rivals who have changed names.
+
+## What it does
+
+- Scans the in-game friend list after login and on each game tick while logged in.
+- Listens for friends-chat member joins.
+- Alerts when RuneLite reports both a current name and a different previous name for a player.
+- Optionally filters alerts to a comma-separated list of previous names.
+- De-duplicates repeated alerts for the same `previous name -> current name` pair during the current plugin session.
+
+This plugin does not call Wise Old Man, TempleOSRS, the RuneScape hiscores, or any other external API. All detection is based on RuneLite client data (`Nameable#getPrevName`) available in the local client.
+
+## Configuration
+
+| Setting | Default | Description |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Tracked previous names | blank | Comma-separated previous names to watch. Leave blank to alert for every previous/current-name pair RuneLite exposes. |
+| Chat alerts | enabled | Sends a RuneLite game message when a watched name change is seen. |
+| Alert once per session | enabled | Suppresses repeat alerts for the same pair until the plugin restarts. |
+
+## Local development
+
+Use Java 11 for RuneLite compatibility:
+
+```bash
+export JAVA_HOME=/opt/data/jdks/current-java11
+export PATH="$JAVA_HOME/bin:$PATH"
+./gradlew test --no-daemon -q
+./gradlew assemble --no-daemon -q
+```
+
+To launch RuneLite in developer mode with the plugin loaded:
+
+```bash
+export JAVA_HOME=/opt/data/jdks/current-java11
+export PATH="$JAVA_HOME/bin:$PATH"
+./gradlew run --no-daemon
+```
+
+## Manual RuneLite test checklist
+
+1. Start the plugin with `./gradlew run --no-daemon`.
+2. Open the plugin configuration panel and confirm the three settings appear under "Name Change Watcher".
+3. Leave "Tracked previous names" blank and log into an account with friends that have known previous names, or add one such previous name to the filter.
+4. Confirm a game chat message appears in the form `Previous Name is now known as Current Name`.
+5. Toggle "Alert once per session" off and verify repeated scans can re-emit the alert; toggle it back on and verify repeats are suppressed.
+6. Join a friends chat containing a member with a previous name and confirm the join event can produce the same alert.
+
+## Plugin metadata
+
+- Display name: `Name Change Watcher`
+- Package: `com.itmeansbigmountain.namechangewatcher`
+- Main plugin class: `NameChangeWatcherPlugin`
+- Config group: `namechangewatcher`
+- External API usage: none
+
+## Plugin Hub prep notes
+
+Before submitting to RuneLite Plugin Hub, perform the manual checklist above with a live client and capture a screenshot or short GIF of the chat alert/config panel if maintainers request visual proof.
